      "writtenOn": "2020-03-27T16:54:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How much code would you need if you do \"ec_comm sethash \u003chash\u003e\"? \"ec_comm corrupt\" would be useful only for FAFT while \"ec_comm sethash\" can be used for manually syncing Hmir with Heff as well as uncorrupting a hash.\n\nI\u0027m not sure how guilty we would feel to add as much code as this CL is adding just for testing a corner case.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 326,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 326,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "33639598dc4485034eb16505d069005ea76989ca",
